-- =====================================================
-- 10. REQUIREMENT SUBMISSIONS
-- Every required document for each learner's entry status at first
-- enrollment, plus optional ones. Deliberate gaps: Daniel never handed in
-- Form 137 (his enrollment stayed pending, then was cancelled); Patricia is
-- missing Form 137 and her Good Moral is logged but not submitted (pending);
-- Christian's transferee documents are not verified yet; Jeremiah's Form 137
-- was presented in the original and has no scan. Files are placeholder PDFs
-- under each service's media/requirements/ (gitignored).
-- =====================================================

